        <mxCell id="frame" parent="1" style="html=1;shape=mxgraph.sysml.package;overflow=fill;labelX=225;strokeWidth=2;align=center;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#000000;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;margin-left:7px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;REQ [Autonomous Vehicle]&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1025" width="1380" x="10" y="13" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" value="«requirement»&lt;br&gt;REQ-001&lt;br&gt;The smart car shall operate autonomously by following a black line, responding to obstacles, and resuming line following after each maneuver.&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;Id = &quot;REQ-001&quot;&lt;br&gt;Priority = High&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="390" x="495" y="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" value="«requirement»&#xa;REQ-002&#xa;The system shall detect the line using IR sensors.&#xa;&#xa;Id = &quot;REQ-002&quot;&#xa;Priority = High" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="265" x="70" y="255" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" value="«requirement»&#xa;REQ-003&#xa;The system shall detect obstacles using ultrasonic sensors.&#xa;&#xa;Id = &quot;REQ-003&quot;&#xa;Priority = High" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="265" x="425" y="255" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" value="«requirement»&#xa;REQ-004&#xa;The system shall move the car using two motors.&#xa;&#xa;Id = &quot;REQ-004&quot;&#xa;Priority = High" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="265" x="780" y="255" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" value="«requirement»&lt;br&gt;REQ-005&lt;br&gt;The system shall adjust the motor speed and steering commands to maintain stable and accurate line tracking.&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;Id = &quot;REQ-005&quot;&lt;br&gt;Priority = High&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="235" x="1135" y="255" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r6" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" value="«requirement»&#xa;REQ-006&#xa;The car shall detect and avoid the first obstacle autonomously, reacquire the black line, and resume line following.&#xa;&#xa;Id = &quot;REQ-006&quot;&#xa;Priority = High" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="155" width="310" x="465" y="480" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r7" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" value="«requirement»&#xa;REQ-007&#xa;The car shall perform a 180° turn after detecting the second obstacle, reacquire the black line, and continue autonomous line following.&#xa;&#xa;Id = &quot;REQ-007&quot;&#xa;Priority = High" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="155" width="345" x="840" y="480" as="geometry" />
